WEBVTT

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:05.160
Every referrer’s own report form –
completed from your clinic notes.

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:10.990
Insurers, medico-legal companies and
case managers each send their own form.

00:00:11.123 --> 00:00:14.973
And your team retypes the
same notes into every one.

00:00:15.172 --> 00:00:19.712
Upload each referrer’s form
once, exactly as it arrived.

00:00:19.842 --> 00:00:24.220
It maps the questions, and where
each answer goes on the page.

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:29.290
Your team checks it once; then
it’s reused for every patient.

00:00:29.465 --> 00:00:32.995
Now pick the patient –
or upload their notes.

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:37.498
Choose the referrer’s form, and the
answers are drafted from the notes,

00:00:37.498 --> 00:00:39.600
straight into its original layout.

00:00:39.744 --> 00:00:42.329
Every answer shows its source.

00:00:42.419 --> 00:00:45.369
One click, and there’s
the note it came from.

00:00:45.526 --> 00:00:51.279
Anything not in the notes – like a
prognosis – is flagged, never guessed.

00:00:51.369 --> 00:00:54.509
Opinions only ever come from a clinician.

00:00:54.644 --> 00:00:59.769
The physiotherapist adds her opinion,
checks every answer and approves.

00:00:59.859 --> 00:01:02.599
Nothing is issued until she does.

00:01:02.725 --> 00:01:06.662
Then download the referrer’s
own Word or PDF file –

00:01:06.662 --> 00:01:09.905
completed, in their layout, ready to send.

00:01:10.033 --> 00:01:12.722
If an insurer uses an online portal,

00:01:12.722 --> 00:01:16.382
every approved answer is
ready to copy and paste.

00:01:16.472 --> 00:01:19.472
One at a time, or all at once.

00:01:19.739 --> 00:01:24.919
ClinForms. Their form, your
notes, your clinician’s sign-off.

00:01:25.009 --> 00:01:29.479
Book a 15-minute call at clinforms.co.uk.
